WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.140
What's playing out on headlines and

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.690
television screens today in Venezuela is

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.460
a confrontation with the narco-

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.740
dictatorship. It began in 1998 when Hugo

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.590
Chavez was elected. He immediately

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.449
began to dismantle the democratic

00:00:18.449 --> 00:00:20.850
institutions of Venezuela, and consolidate power

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.460
into the hands of the executive. That

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.800
revolution also made common cause with

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.390
narco-traffickers, with terrorist

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.330
organizations, with hostile regimes. Before

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.940
he died in 2013, Chavez designated Nicolas

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.940
Maduro as his successor, and Maduro has

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.910
used brute force to hold on to power. In

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.300
2015, the democratic opposition won in a

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.370
landslide in the congressional elections.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.070
Unfortunately, the regime has done

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.600
everything it possibly can to

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.300
consolidate its own power and to prevent

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.399
the Democratic National Assembly from

00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:54.989
operating. We're in the midst of a

00:00:54.989 --> 00:00:57.300
political crisis now, as you have a clash

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.760
of these institutions between the strong

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.410
executive (which is really a dictatorship),

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.879
and the National Assembly,

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.960
representing a democratic opposition.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:07.740
What are your thoughts about the crisis

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.720
in Venezuela? Please let us know in your

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.820
comments, and also let us know what other

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.160
topics you want AEI scholars to cover in 60 seconds.

